ass="Herostyled__ContainerWrapper-sc-b0wmrt-4 jcVqIs"><div class="Herostyled__Text-sc-b0wmrt-5 dUXuJA"><p class="heading-kicker">Software de mantenimiento de equipos de gimnasio y fitness</p><h1 class="Herostyled__Heading-sc-b0wmrt-6 eUBpqQ heading">Alinee su mantenimiento de equipos de gimnasio en un solo lugar.</h1><div class="subhead"><div class="HeroImageAndVideo__Subhead-zukoc0-5 exsxsM">
  <div class="landing-Intro__text">
    <div class="landing-Intro__text--description">
      <div class="HeroImageAndVideo__Subhead-zukoc0-5 prbrB">
        <div class="landing-Intro__text">
          <div class="landing-Intro__text--description">
            <div class="landing-Intro__text">
              <div class="landing-Intro__text--description">
                <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Your customers want an unparalleled exercise experience. At-home fitness could never compete with the community and variety offered in a gym. Welcome your customers back to sturdy fitness equipment and a clean environment with UpKeep’s maintenance tracking and planning tool.&nbsp;</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div></div><div class="Herostyled__Column-sc-b0wmrt-7 kkURUa"><div class="Herostyled__Buttons-sc-b0wmrt-8 gDYkMb"><a variant="Filled - Steel" aria-label="Agendar una visita" data-link-type="internal-link" class="CallToActionstyled__applySharedStyles-sc-2h7j2i-0 itJcOj primary-button " href="https://upkeep.com/es/demo/">Agendar una visita</a><a variant="Outline - Steel" aria-label="Registro de prueba gratuita" data-link-type="internal-link" class="CallToActionstyled__applySharedStyles-sc-2h7j2i-0 bpmgvi secondary-button " href="https://upkeep.com/es/free-trial-signup/">Registro de prueba gratuita</a></div><p class="disclaimer">No se requiere tarjeta de crédito.</p></div></div></div><div class="Herostyled__Media-sc-b0wmrt-10 jhmWGj"><div class="FeatureContent__FeaturedImage-sc-1vs3j48-0 jagknr"><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper="" class="gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained gatsby-image UpKeep"><div style="max-width:1946px;display:block"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20height=&#39;2612&#39;%20width=&#39;1946&#39;%20xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39;%20version=&#39;1.1&#39;%3E%3C/svg%3E" style="max-width:100%;display:block;position:static"></div><img aria-hidden="true" data-placeholder-image="" style="opacity: 0; transition: opacity 500ms linear; object-fit: cover;" decoding="async" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""><img width="1946" height="2612" data-main-image="" style="object-fit: cover; opacity: 1;" sizes="(min-width: 1946px) 1946px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="eager" src="./archivo_files/1608158632-fitness-2x.png" srcset="https://www.datocms-assets.com/38028/1608158632-fitness-2x.png?auto=compress&amp;dpr=0.26&amp;fm=webp&amp;w=1946 487w,
