https://www.datocms-assets.com/38028/1709708294-pexels-kateryna-babaieva-2760242.jpg?auto=compress&amp;fm=webp&amp;w=500 500w" alt="Testimonial"><noscript><img width="500" height="333" data-main-image="" style="object-fit:cover;opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 500px) 500px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://www.datocms-assets.com/38028/1709708294-pexels-kateryna-babaieva-2760242.jpg?auto=compress&amp;fm=webp&amp;w=500" srcSet="https://www.datocms-assets.com/38028/1709708294-pexels-kateryna-babaieva-2760242.jpg?auto=compress&amp;dpr=0.25&amp;fm=webp&amp;w=500 125w,
