https://www.datocms-assets.com/38028/1709747219-water-oil-rig.png?auto=compress&amp;fm=webp&amp;w=600 600w" alt="Testimonial"><noscript><img width="600" height="300" data-main-image="" style="object-fit:cover;opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://www.datocms-assets.com/38028/1709747219-water-oil-rig.png?auto=compress&amp;fm=webp&amp;w=600" srcSet="https://www.datocms-assets.com/38028/1709747219-water-oil-rig.png?auto=compress&amp;dpr=0.25&amp;fm=webp&amp;w=600 150w,
